Third-party data
================

guest.js looks up a guest's country from their IP address with the
"GeoFeed + Whois + ASN" country database from ip-location-db
(https://github.com/sapics/ip-location-db), npm package
@ip-location-db/geo-whois-asn-country-mmdb.

